ta","data":[{"unit":1,"title":133,"area":134,"prev":136,"next":138,"titles":141,"firmware":32},{"id":2,"title":3,"aliases":4,"area":11,"order":12,"path":13,"context":14,"summary":20,"status":21,"firmware":22,"facts":27,"procedures":46,"parameters":111,"related":112,"body":117,"sources":118,"official_url":36,"controls":125},"howto.acid-bass","Recipe — a squelchy acid bass",[5,6,7,8,9,10],"acid","acid bass","acid line","squelch","resonant bass","sliding bass","howto",44,"knowledge/manual/units/howto/acid-bass.md",{"modes":15,"screens":17},[16],"instrument",[18,19],"M3","M2","On the bass track pick the ladder filter, set a low cutoff, high resonance and a strong, short filter envelope, then play mode legato with a little portamento so that overlapping notes slide.","current",{"min":23,"changed_in":24,"guide_version":25,"verified_on":26},"1.0.9",[],"1.1.15",null,[28,34,38,42],{"id":29,"text":30,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":32,"confidence":33},"type-return","Picking a filter type from `shift + M3` takes you back to `M1`, so press `M3` to go on with the filter.","docs/research/59-screen-profiling.md#23-filter-instrument-m3","1.1.33","verified",{"id":8,"text":35,"source":36,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":37},"A low cutoff, high resonance and a large envelope amount with a short filter decay make each note open and snap shut, the acid squelch.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#filter","derived",{"id":39,"text":40,"source":41,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":37},"slide","In legato play mode one note sounds at a time, and portamento makes overlapping notes glide from one pitch to the next.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#envelopes",{"id":43,"text":44,"source":45,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":37},"accents","Parameter locks on the cutoff or the envelope amount for single steps give the line its accents.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/sequencer#step-sequencing",[47,83],{"id":48,"goal":49,"preconditions":50,"steps":52,"result":26,"source":36,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":37},"filter","Give the bass on `T3` a squelchy filter",[51],"instrument mode",[53,56,59,65,67,72,78],{"keys":54,"note":55,"set":26},"T3 → shift + M3","the filter types",{"keys":57,"note":58,"set":26},"turn E1","highlight ladder",{"keys":60,"note":61,"set":62},"click E1","takes it and goes back to `M1`",{"param":63,"value":64},"filter type","ladder",{"keys":18,"note":66,"set":26},"press it again if the page shows off",{"keys":57,"note":68,"set":69},"cutoff around 20",{"param":70,"value":71},"cutoff",20,{"keys":73,"note":74,"set":75},"turn E2","resonance around 70",{"param":76,"value":77},"resonance",70,{"keys":79,"note":80,"set":81},"turn E3","envelope amount around 70",{"param":82,"value":77},"env amount",{"id":84,"goal":85,"preconditions":86,"steps":87,"result":26,"source":41,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":37},"envelope","Snap the filter shut and let the notes slide",[],[88,90,95,100,106],{"keys":19,"note":89,"set":26},"click an encoder until the filter envelope is in front",{"keys":73,"note":91,"set":92},"filter decay around 25",{"param":93,"value":94},"filter decay",25,{"keys":79,"note":96,"set":97},"filter sustain 0",{"param":98,"value":99},"filter sustain",0,{"keys":101,"note":102,"set":103},"shift + turn E1","play mode legato",{"param":104,"value":105},"play mode","legato",{"keys":107,"note":108,"set":109},"shift + turn E2","portamento around 20",{"param":110,"value":71},"portamento",[],[113,114,115,116],"instrument.filter","instrument.play-mode","sequencer.parameter-locks","howto.wobble","Acid lives in the filter: a bright snap at the start of each note that closes almost at once, with\nresonance singing at the cutoff. Program the line with some notes overlapping so they slide (a note\nslides into the next only when it lasts past the next one's start; written end to end they only\ntouch, and the next starts anew), a